WEBVTT

00:14.700 --> 00:17.500
♪The Upper Three hold the seals♪

00:17.540 --> 00:21.380
♪A valiant general, an opera star, and a ruthless cripple♪

00:21.980 --> 00:24.420
♪The Middle Three stir the clouds♪

00:24.500 --> 00:29.140
♪A fiend, a wandering hero, and a master of the blade♪

00:30.540 --> 00:33.220
♪The Lower Three deal in gold♪

00:33.540 --> 00:37.500
♪A beauty, a seer, and a scholar♪

00:37.860 --> 00:40.780
♪The Upper, Middle, and Lower Three♪

00:41.620 --> 00:49.300
♪Represent the nine houses of old Changsha♪

00:49.900 --> 00:51.380
♪Together, they are known♪

00:52.060 --> 00:56.660
♪As the Mystic Nine♪

01:25.660 --> 01:31.900
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

01:32.060 --> 01:34.980
[Episode 9]
[This story is purely fictional]

01:37.430 --> 01:38.130
I did it.

02:05.040 --> 02:05.540
Master.

02:06.070 --> 02:07.820
We've been walking, but we still haven't found Unit 401.

02:08.520 --> 02:09.850
Perhaps they never came here?

02:12.190 --> 02:14.410
If only we had Fifth Master's

02:14.710 --> 02:15.690
dogs.

02:16.750 --> 02:18.010
They only obey

02:18.520 --> 02:19.820
their master's command anyway.

02:22.430 --> 02:24.450
What if I start raising one myself?

02:24.560 --> 02:25.380
That will work.

02:25.910 --> 02:27.010
Once this is over,

02:27.630 --> 02:28.660
I'll ask him to give me a dog.

02:29.560 --> 02:30.850
You might as well change your name.

02:31.470 --> 02:32.290
To what?

02:32.630 --> 02:33.450
Wu Tiezui.

02:34.870 --> 02:35.660
Wu Tiezui?

02:36.120 --> 02:37.130
It sounds great.

02:38.680 --> 02:40.260
Lucky for me, I just want a pet dog.

02:42.310 --> 02:42.780
Master.

02:48.870 --> 02:49.450
Careful.

02:51.800 --> 02:52.220
Close in.

02:52.240 --> 02:52.610
Yes.

03:05.840 --> 03:06.500
Xiaoyu.

03:07.470 --> 03:08.980
Is it Unit 401?

03:12.680 --> 03:13.170
Who are you?

03:14.080 --> 03:14.820
Tell us your name.

03:43.840 --> 03:45.130
Master, it's a dummy.

03:49.120 --> 03:49.940
A trap.

03:50.310 --> 03:50.780
Master Zhang.

03:51.360 --> 03:53.100
It doesn't look like the cages are from the Otherworld Tower.

03:53.520 --> 03:54.340
They are quite new.

03:57.910 --> 03:59.290
Master, come quick.

04:01.470 --> 04:02.170
Weird.

04:02.400 --> 04:03.610
Why is there a lamp here?

04:05.750 --> 04:07.010
Master, something is written on top.

04:13.280 --> 04:14.610
Far East Conquest Medal.

04:16.120 --> 04:16.730
It's the medal

04:18.000 --> 04:19.250
for the Japanese who volunteered to work on conquered lands.

04:20.190 --> 04:20.980
A Japanese

04:21.680 --> 04:22.490
this deep?

04:23.480 --> 04:24.460
Dress his wound.

04:24.920 --> 04:25.980
Let's venture deeper.

04:28.390 --> 04:30.250
Things will become more complicated

04:30.270 --> 04:31.140
if the Japanese are involved.

04:54.000 --> 04:54.410
Master.

04:55.190 --> 04:56.930
The Japanese set up a defense base here.

04:57.830 --> 04:59.290
It seems like there were a lot of Japanese here.

05:02.950 --> 05:04.660
A crossfire formation.

05:07.120 --> 05:07.730
They feared

05:08.390 --> 05:10.020
something in this tower.

05:11.000 --> 05:11.850
Is it the shadow?

05:13.600 --> 05:14.610
It can't be that simple.

05:15.310 --> 05:17.460
How did they find out about this tower?

05:18.430 --> 05:19.490
And why did they come here?

05:22.040 --> 05:23.930
If the Japanese are involved,

05:24.070 --> 05:25.580
this must be a huge conspiracy.

05:26.040 --> 05:27.410
The Otherworld Tower is just a small part of it.

05:27.920 --> 05:29.250
They must have done much more

05:29.270 --> 05:30.370
than we know so far.

05:32.160 --> 05:33.170
Let's not dally.

05:39.940 --> 05:46.140
[Xie's Residence]

05:50.060 --> 05:53.060
[Xie's Residence]

05:55.500 --> 05:57.540
[Xie's Residence]

06:04.980 --> 06:07.660
[Xie Jiu, Xie Clan of the Mystic Nine]

06:15.870 --> 06:17.610
The game is doomed.

06:17.720 --> 06:19.660
There's no point in trying.

06:24.390 --> 06:25.490
A pawn

06:26.830 --> 06:28.290
can turn the game around.

06:30.510 --> 06:31.900
Oh, Xie Jiu.

06:33.600 --> 06:34.980
As stubborn as ever.

06:37.040 --> 06:38.220
But this time,

06:39.190 --> 06:41.220
despite taking everything into account,

06:42.040 --> 06:44.170
you won't be able to protect yourself.

06:48.080 --> 06:50.020
Information about you studying in Japan

06:50.630 --> 06:52.020
has reached the Ministry of War today.

06:53.500 --> 06:55.380
[Xie Jiu's Academic Information]

07:01.160 --> 07:02.200
Less than 10,000 people

07:02.200 --> 07:04.490
went to Japan to study during this period.

07:05.270 --> 07:08.780
You think they are all Japanese sympathizers?

07:10.000 --> 07:11.660
Unlike you, those students

07:12.480 --> 07:14.730
are not close to Kinoshita.

07:17.070 --> 07:18.980
Kinoshita and I are just friends.

07:19.390 --> 07:20.540
Just friends?

07:22.120 --> 07:22.980
He is the head

07:23.000 --> 07:24.610
of the Chamber of Commerce in Japan.

07:25.190 --> 07:27.170
Three years ago, a letter from you

07:27.360 --> 07:29.520
convinced him to withdraw funds immediately,

07:29.520 --> 07:31.580
causing the Japanese to suffer a loss after a failed investment

07:31.920 --> 07:33.170
in Xinyue Restaurant.

07:37.720 --> 07:39.370
Kinoshita was my classmate.

07:40.120 --> 07:43.700
When I was studying, my mentor prejudiced against me.

07:44.630 --> 07:45.710
He helped me

07:45.720 --> 07:46.660
to graduate successfully.

07:47.430 --> 07:48.730
I owed him a favor.

07:49.360 --> 07:50.370
That letter

07:52.270 --> 07:54.020
was to return him the favor.

07:54.950 --> 07:55.930
Return him the favor?

07:57.070 --> 07:57.930
So you admit

07:58.000 --> 07:59.730
that you have dealings with the Japan Chamber of Commerce.

08:00.630 --> 08:01.880
No wonder you have been able to sell your goods

08:01.880 --> 08:02.900
in Japan all these years,

08:02.900 --> 08:04.700
making your business prosperous.

08:05.800 --> 08:07.020
If you have proof,

08:07.390 --> 08:08.140
you can arrest me.

08:13.480 --> 08:14.340
Xie Jiu.

08:15.920 --> 08:16.980
I am from the Huo Clan.

08:18.120 --> 08:19.410
I'm also part of the Mystic Nine.

08:20.870 --> 08:21.930
If I had a choice,

08:21.950 --> 08:23.290
I would never want to hurt you.

08:31.340 --> 08:32.620
[Confession Letter]

08:36.600 --> 08:37.300
Sign it.

08:38.080 --> 08:40.100
Hand over the money you earned by working with the Japanese.

08:40.550 --> 08:41.580
I can make sure you're safe.

08:42.960 --> 08:44.010
Knowing your talent,

08:44.240 --> 08:46.370
I'm sure you can change your name and make a comeback in a few years.

08:52.000 --> 08:53.770
Xie is my ancestral name.

08:55.240 --> 08:56.250
I will not change it.

09:05.200 --> 09:06.180
Who would have known

09:08.320 --> 09:10.650
that you would be willing to die for your family name?

09:13.480 --> 09:14.770
Should I say you're smart

09:16.150 --> 09:17.060
or dumb?

09:25.600 --> 09:27.100
I heard an agent from the Japanese Home Ministry

09:27.150 --> 09:29.420
was killed while infiltrating Changsha.

09:29.790 --> 09:31.890
They sure are interested in this place.

09:32.870 --> 09:33.770
To avoid any allegations,

09:34.360 --> 09:35.890
you should just stay here.

10:24.600 --> 10:25.530
A Japanese flag?

10:42.340 --> 10:44.660
[Type 89 Grenade Discharger]

11:12.320 --> 11:12.820
Master!

11:43.080 --> 11:43.530
Master.

11:44.510 --> 11:45.300
They were Japanese soldiers.

11:46.080 --> 11:47.220
They all committed seppuku.

11:52.550 --> 11:53.700
They killed themselves.

12:11.480 --> 12:12.100
Master Zhang.

12:12.910 --> 12:13.820
This is odd.

12:14.790 --> 12:17.300
The Japanese soldiers were studying the Otherworld Tower.

12:18.600 --> 12:19.730
How come they committed suicide

12:19.960 --> 12:21.580
all of a sudden?

12:23.480 --> 12:24.890
There are many supplies here.

12:25.360 --> 12:26.650
They could have lived here.

12:29.550 --> 12:31.010
Perhaps they were stuck here for too long.

12:31.600 --> 12:32.850
And they knew they couldn't leave this place.

12:33.790 --> 12:35.980
It's possible for them to kill themselves out of despair.

12:36.670 --> 12:38.250
Someone who has lost all hope

12:38.670 --> 12:40.980
would never live in this organized manner.

12:41.630 --> 12:42.340
Besides,

12:42.790 --> 12:43.700
there were many people.

12:44.790 --> 12:47.250
Did they feel despair and commit suicide together?

12:48.150 --> 12:49.610
It doesn't make sense.

12:55.320 --> 12:57.340
I'm familiar with the models here.

12:57.910 --> 12:59.250
Check every corner.

13:01.000 --> 13:02.610
I'm sure we'll find something.

13:10.480 --> 13:11.420
Master, look.

13:16.860 --> 13:18.580
[Top Secret]

13:19.630 --> 13:20.980
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama?

13:23.540 --> 13:24.640
Who is Yoshiyuki Hatoyama?

13:25.230 --> 13:26.040
You weren't there.

13:26.060 --> 13:27.010
Of course, you don't know.

13:27.300 --> 13:28.210
We know him quite well.

13:28.630 --> 13:30.490
No wonder Master Zhang finds this place familiar.

13:30.820 --> 13:32.520
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama was a Japanese explorer.

13:33.030 --> 13:35.110
Do you know that Japanese spies infiltrated Changsha

13:35.110 --> 13:35.970
to look for a copper meteor?

13:36.870 --> 13:37.610
Master has told us, yes.

13:39.110 --> 13:40.760
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama was a cautious man.

13:41.630 --> 13:43.920
Why didn't he burn the letter?

13:44.700 --> 13:45.730
There are many supplies here.

13:45.940 --> 13:47.090
All documents are intact.

13:47.390 --> 13:48.090
It doesn't make sense.

13:49.060 --> 13:50.210
So I don't think these soldiers

13:50.230 --> 13:51.130
killed themselves.

13:51.420 --> 13:52.890
They were hallucinating.

13:53.110 --> 13:55.010
So they didn't have the chance to destroy the documents.

13:55.700 --> 13:57.610
Master Zhang must have already come to this conclusion.

13:57.870 --> 13:59.400
Unlike you, who demanded an explanation from me.

14:01.150 --> 14:01.760
And this...

14:01.780 --> 14:02.440
Are you done?

14:05.630 --> 14:06.850
Yes.

14:10.180 --> 14:10.680
Master Zhang.

14:10.910 --> 14:11.800
It's in Japanese.

14:16.940 --> 14:17.970
Stinky Yu?

14:18.700 --> 14:19.890
When did he learn Japanese?

14:22.030 --> 14:23.890
The Japanese have become more active lately.

14:25.350 --> 14:26.730
Master sent him away to learn Japanese

14:27.300 --> 14:29.760
just

14:30.420 --> 14:31.330
in case.

14:35.300 --> 14:35.730
Master.

14:36.150 --> 14:37.640
This is the addendum to the Hatoyama Report.

14:41.030 --> 14:42.560
This is the First Draft of the Hatoyama Report

14:42.700 --> 14:43.890
that Hatoyama submitted to the Japanese Ministry

14:44.030 --> 14:44.800
of Foreign Affairs.

14:45.390 --> 14:46.560
More than 30 years ago,

14:46.940 --> 14:48.370
Otani Kozui

14:48.750 --> 14:50.330
[Yoshiyuki Hatoyama]
went on an expedition in Central Asia.

14:50.780 --> 14:52.920
He brought many laborers and students

14:53.060 --> 14:54.920
into China.

14:56.460 --> 14:57.040
Five years ago,

14:57.780 --> 14:58.800
as he passed by Changsha,

14:59.180 --> 15:00.330
a subdivision of his expedition team,

15:00.460 --> 15:01.890
led by Japanese entrepreneur and explorer,

15:01.910 --> 15:02.920
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama,

15:03.350 --> 15:04.160
stayed nearly three months

15:04.180 --> 15:05.890
in a town 160km north

15:06.350 --> 15:07.890
to Changsha City.

15:17.300 --> 15:17.920
A week later,

15:18.300 --> 15:19.040
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

15:19.060 --> 15:21.330
submitted a 16-page report to the Japanese Ministry of Foreign Affairs

15:21.750 --> 15:23.330
through the Research Institute for Sino-Japan Trade.

15:23.700 --> 15:25.160
This report is called the Hatoyama Report.

15:26.750 --> 15:27.890
In the report, he claimed

15:28.180 --> 15:29.280
that there was something

15:29.540 --> 15:30.520
beneath Changsha.

15:31.510 --> 15:33.400
It was the copper meteor Master found.

15:35.990 --> 15:36.970
Everyone thought

15:37.180 --> 15:39.280
that everything would be over after the meteor was found.

15:39.940 --> 15:40.400
But in fact,

15:40.420 --> 15:42.250
[Hatoyama Report, Addendum]
there was an addendum.

15:43.030 --> 15:44.560
The confidentiality of this addendum

15:44.870 --> 15:46.250
was even higher than that

15:46.270 --> 15:46.890
of the Hatoyama Report.

15:47.660 --> 15:48.680
It claimed

15:48.990 --> 15:50.440
that somewhere underneath Changsha

15:50.910 --> 15:52.490
housed something more important

15:52.510 --> 15:53.520
than the copper meteor.

15:54.460 --> 15:56.560
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama suggested that they should give up on the meteor

15:56.990 --> 15:58.090
and focus their effort on finding this treasure.

16:10.460 --> 16:10.970
Sir.

16:11.750 --> 16:12.890
How much is this jade fish?

16:13.270 --> 16:14.040
Which one do you like?

16:14.060 --> 16:14.800
Allow me to tell you more about it.

16:16.780 --> 16:18.130
They must be here already.

16:18.420 --> 16:20.330
Come. Let's group up with them.

16:22.150 --> 16:23.760
It seems like the Japanese prioritized the tower

16:24.660 --> 16:26.160
more than the meteor.

16:29.550 --> 16:31.160
Is Yoshiyuki Hatoyama among the soldiers

16:32.460 --> 16:33.610
who killed themselves?

16:37.660 --> 16:39.050
Judging from their uniforms,

16:40.020 --> 16:40.920
they were common soldiers.

16:41.630 --> 16:42.960
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama wasn't here.

16:43.250 --> 16:46.690
[The Eve of Entry]

16:48.870 --> 16:49.640
Master, look.

16:50.260 --> 16:51.610
Their group photo before they came to China.

16:53.070 --> 16:54.530
The number does not match.

16:55.220 --> 16:56.850
At least half of the men are not here.

16:58.110 --> 16:58.610
Master Zhang.

17:00.180 --> 17:01.090
If that's the case,

17:01.940 --> 17:04.240
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama must be deeper

17:04.700 --> 17:05.680
inside this tower.

17:05.980 --> 17:06.440
Master.

17:06.980 --> 17:08.090
I found some journals.

17:08.610 --> 17:10.290
[Journals]

17:10.980 --> 17:12.370
So many documents are still intact.

17:13.500 --> 17:14.400
There is another possibility.

17:15.460 --> 17:16.920
They believed that once they came here,

17:18.390 --> 17:20.290
they couldn't leave anymore.

17:32.660 --> 17:33.290
Master!

17:34.790 --> 17:35.290
Master!

17:36.740 --> 17:37.770
I'm so glad you're safe.

17:38.310 --> 17:39.440
We were worried sick.

17:40.630 --> 17:41.160
Master.

17:43.390 --> 17:43.850
Master?

17:54.420 --> 17:55.330
What's the matter, Master?

17:56.260 --> 17:56.890
Juanlian.

17:58.550 --> 17:59.480
Are you hurt?

18:00.500 --> 18:01.370
No.

18:02.940 --> 18:03.810
Are you sure?

18:04.630 --> 18:05.200
Yes.

18:08.260 --> 18:09.240
Do you remember

18:09.740 --> 18:10.610
what happened just now?

18:11.980 --> 18:12.530
Yes.

18:14.220 --> 18:15.160
We received

18:15.180 --> 18:16.440
the drawing you asked Tu to deliver.

18:17.220 --> 18:18.720
We followed your instructions in the letter

18:19.350 --> 18:19.960
and

18:20.630 --> 18:22.440
we teleported here.

18:24.940 --> 18:25.850
What's wrong, Master?

18:30.350 --> 18:30.890
Master!

18:30.890 --> 18:31.570
Master!

18:32.590 --> 18:33.440
Master!

18:38.910 --> 18:39.440
Heifeng.

18:41.260 --> 18:41.850
Aolie.

18:42.740 --> 18:43.920
Where were you, Master?

18:44.220 --> 18:45.110
We were so worried.

18:45.110 --> 18:47.130
I knew you'd be safe, Master.

18:52.910 --> 18:53.400
Laogou.

19:00.310 --> 19:00.890
Laogou.

19:09.940 --> 19:10.480
Xiangu.

19:32.460 --> 19:32.960
Laogou.

19:41.980 --> 19:42.480
Laogou.

19:53.220 --> 19:53.850
Laogou.

19:54.550 --> 19:56.050
Did something happen to you just now?

19:57.570 --> 20:02.730
♪Your beauty resembles a pristine portrait♪

20:03.130 --> 20:08.090
♪When will the white horse return? I keep thinking about you♪

20:10.980 --> 20:11.480
Xiangu.

20:14.110 --> 20:14.850
When we're out,

20:16.740 --> 20:17.610
let's get married.

20:20.980 --> 20:21.770
What?

20:25.220 --> 20:25.960
Listen to me.

20:27.110 --> 20:28.960
Your clan thinks you're an eyesore.

20:29.700 --> 20:31.370
Ding Qiansui only makes things difficult for you.

20:32.660 --> 20:34.160
Even though you are the head of your clan,

20:35.500 --> 20:36.850
things must have been quite tough for you.

20:40.460 --> 20:41.160
Join my clan.

20:42.550 --> 20:43.290
Just join my clan.

20:44.220 --> 20:45.160
You can lead people.

20:45.550 --> 20:46.530
You'll still be in the Mystic Nine.

20:46.740 --> 20:47.610
Nothing will change.

20:48.460 --> 20:49.680
But I'll be there to protect you.

20:51.020 --> 20:52.370
You will not endure any hardship.

20:53.810 --> 20:59.410
♪Even after a few cycles of time♪

20:59.890 --> 21:05.690
♪I wish my heart still lights up the way when we first met♪

21:09.660 --> 21:10.160
Xiangu.

21:12.090 --> 21:17.410
♪Don't wait until your life becomes full of regrets♪

21:20.660 --> 21:22.240
Did something happen to you just now as well?

21:23.790 --> 21:25.160
I think I had a dream.

21:27.590 --> 21:29.240
I dreamed that in my past life,

21:30.420 --> 21:31.890
I was the owner of an embroidery workshop.

21:32.910 --> 21:33.640
In my dream,

21:34.550 --> 21:35.400
I saw my sister

21:37.310 --> 21:38.200
and my aunt.

21:41.610 --> 21:45.370
♪We first met♪

21:48.180 --> 21:50.090
This must be the tower's doing.

22:04.590 --> 22:05.570
Tell me more.

22:23.980 --> 22:25.400
We still don't know

22:26.310 --> 22:27.920
what is going on right now.

22:30.350 --> 22:30.920
Let's

22:32.910 --> 22:34.130
focus on what we need to do first.

22:35.830 --> 22:36.480
Okay?

22:41.660 --> 22:43.960
Master, the Zhang Clan is not here at all.

22:44.220 --> 22:45.480
Should we whistle to signal them?

22:47.910 --> 22:48.720
Don't wait for them.

22:49.460 --> 22:51.330
Save Tianpeng and Runty first.

23:12.740 --> 23:13.530
Master!

23:14.590 --> 23:16.160
We're stuck here!

23:17.220 --> 23:19.200
Master, it is Tianpeng and the rest.

23:20.460 --> 23:22.090
Be careful of the traps!

23:23.180 --> 23:23.810
Split and search.

23:55.420 --> 23:56.400
This is a yin-yang lock.

23:57.070 --> 23:58.130
The yang catch is here.

23:58.590 --> 23:59.610
The yin catch is somewhere else.

24:00.830 --> 24:02.570
We need to operate them at the same time to solve it.

24:08.260 --> 24:08.960
This time,

24:10.910 --> 24:12.050
I'll solve it correctly.

24:15.220 --> 24:16.090
I'll find the yin catch.

24:16.660 --> 24:17.480
Two of you will stay here.

24:18.660 --> 24:19.290
Remember.

24:20.390 --> 24:23.290
The solution is left three, right two,

24:24.310 --> 24:25.160
left one, right three,

24:25.830 --> 24:27.440
left four, left two.

24:28.310 --> 24:28.770
No matter

24:29.310 --> 24:30.440
what you hear later,

24:30.940 --> 24:31.440
you must

24:31.460 --> 24:32.850
follow the solution I just gave you.

24:33.420 --> 24:34.480
Especially the last step.

24:35.310 --> 24:36.530
Two clicks to the left.

24:37.870 --> 24:38.810
Do not mess this up.

24:39.660 --> 24:40.090
Yes.

24:45.110 --> 24:45.610
Laogou.

24:46.630 --> 24:47.610
You're hiding something from us.

24:52.700 --> 24:53.160
Yes.

24:56.180 --> 24:57.370
But it's not a big deal.

24:58.910 --> 24:59.530
Just trust me.

25:00.700 --> 25:01.850
We have to get out of here alive.

25:02.940 --> 25:05.850
Once we're out, I'll tell you everything.

25:07.070 --> 25:07.610
Okay?

25:14.390 --> 25:16.770
Juanlian, Xiangu, you two solve the puzzle.

25:17.390 --> 25:18.160
Heifeng, Aolie.

25:18.660 --> 25:19.610
Stay in the corridor.

25:19.630 --> 25:20.090
Yes!

25:36.390 --> 25:36.890
Get in position.

25:37.910 --> 25:38.440
Now.

25:41.870 --> 25:42.720
Everything is in order.

25:53.420 --> 25:54.000
Left three.

25:56.700 --> 25:57.240
Left three.

26:04.390 --> 26:05.000
Right two.

26:06.740 --> 26:07.240
Right two.

26:12.500 --> 26:13.160
Left one.

26:13.870 --> 26:14.370
Left one.

26:16.740 --> 26:17.330
Right three.

26:18.700 --> 26:19.160
Right two.

26:20.420 --> 26:20.890
Right two.

26:23.220 --> 26:23.770
Right three.

26:33.350 --> 26:34.050
Left four.

26:42.460 --> 26:43.200
Right three?

26:48.080 --> 26:49.130
Shoot!

26:50.070 --> 26:51.050
It made one more noise.

26:55.700 --> 26:57.200
Did I mishear Master?

26:57.740 --> 26:59.640
How come it's right three?

27:00.260 --> 27:01.050
It should be...

27:01.590 --> 27:02.370
Right three!

27:03.110 --> 27:04.810
Turn it! Now!

27:12.590 --> 27:14.380
Juanlian, the tower is deceiving you!

27:14.830 --> 27:15.680
Don't turn it!

27:16.590 --> 27:18.670
Juanlian, don't dally.

27:18.830 --> 27:20.530
Turn it now!

27:24.420 --> 27:24.960
What are you doing?

27:27.020 --> 27:28.440
You turned it four times. That was wrong.

27:28.870 --> 27:30.720
Master said right three.

27:49.390 --> 27:49.890
Laogou.

27:50.740 --> 27:51.370
Are you all right?

27:59.940 --> 28:00.530
I'm fine.

28:04.460 --> 28:05.160
Just wait for me.

28:05.700 --> 28:06.570
I'll be back soon.

28:32.630 --> 28:34.400
Tianpeng. Zhenyuan.

28:47.790 --> 28:48.240
Xiangu.

28:48.940 --> 28:49.610
Are you okay?

28:50.020 --> 28:50.530
Are you hurt?

28:50.790 --> 28:51.330
I'm fine.

28:51.790 --> 28:53.400
Unfortunately, the shadow escaped.

28:58.700 --> 28:59.370
Thank goodness.

28:59.700 --> 29:00.200
How are you?

29:02.590 --> 29:03.160
Tianpeng.

29:04.590 --> 29:06.440
Wake up, Tianpeng.

29:08.500 --> 29:08.960
Zhenyuan.

29:09.700 --> 29:11.000
Wake up.

29:16.630 --> 29:17.850
My head hurts.

29:18.500 --> 29:19.000
Are you okay?

29:21.220 --> 29:21.680
Zhenyuan.

29:25.390 --> 29:25.890
Master.

29:29.910 --> 29:30.960
I'm so glad everyone is fine.

29:32.700 --> 29:33.720
I'm so glad everyone is fine.

29:38.110 --> 29:38.680
Master.

30:00.180 --> 30:00.680
Master,

30:01.500 --> 30:02.240
I'll read

30:02.550 --> 30:04.240
Jun Tanaka's journal in chronological

30:04.390 --> 30:05.050
order.

30:05.500 --> 30:06.480
April 15th.

30:07.110 --> 30:08.000
Our team

30:08.740 --> 30:09.810
of 54 men

30:10.590 --> 30:12.160
were led by Colonel Hatoyama

30:12.700 --> 30:13.960
into the Otherworld Tower.

30:31.910 --> 30:33.640
Colonel Hatoyama said

30:34.260 --> 30:36.890
that we needed to find a hidden treasure

30:37.180 --> 30:38.850
deep inside the Otherworld Tower.

30:39.660 --> 30:41.090
He said it could change the future,

30:41.910 --> 30:42.400
but he

30:42.940 --> 30:46.610
refused to tell us more.

30:50.220 --> 30:51.000
May 3rd.

30:52.660 --> 30:53.680
We spent two weeks

30:54.460 --> 30:58.000
lost in this maze.

31:06.630 --> 31:07.610
Meanwhile,

31:07.820 --> 31:09.770
Zhang Qishan took over the Mystic Nine

31:10.460 --> 31:11.920
and cleared out all our spies in Changsha.

31:12.420 --> 31:14.160
All our informants in Changsha

31:14.390 --> 31:17.130
were killed by the Mystic Nine.

31:17.740 --> 31:18.810
May 20th.

31:19.460 --> 31:21.960
We are still lost in this maze.

31:22.590 --> 31:24.530
Our stamina is at our limit.

31:25.790 --> 31:27.770
The Otherworld Tower is eerie.

31:27.910 --> 31:29.050
But to our surprise,

31:29.790 --> 31:31.160
something even more unsettling

31:31.180 --> 31:32.160
took place.

31:34.570 --> 31:36.370
[Jun Tanaka]

31:36.660 --> 31:38.530
A squad of eight men vanished.

31:39.390 --> 31:42.200
They were just right in front of us,

31:42.660 --> 31:44.130
but no matter how fast we ran,

31:44.590 --> 31:46.050
we couldn't catch up to them.

31:47.220 --> 31:49.160
We've tried many ways.

31:49.940 --> 31:51.000
In the end,

31:51.310 --> 31:52.850
we can confirm that they always maintain

31:53.070 --> 31:54.640
a distance of 800m from us.

31:57.790 --> 31:59.090
So this is our distance?

31:59.500 --> 32:06.530
Perhaps we're supposed to defy logic.

32:31.350 --> 32:32.570
We found out why

32:32.910 --> 32:34.200
we could never catch up to them.

32:35.150 --> 32:37.720
It seems like

32:38.260 --> 32:39.680
something not belonging to this world

32:40.150 --> 32:41.610
was among the squad.

32:45.350 --> 32:45.810
Master.

32:46.260 --> 32:47.200
This page has been torn as well.

32:49.110 --> 32:50.610
We flipped through the journals.

32:51.460 --> 32:52.890
How come many of them have been torn off?

32:56.220 --> 32:56.770
Carry on.

32:58.350 --> 32:59.440
October 27th.

33:01.150 --> 33:03.050
We have spent too long underground.

33:04.940 --> 33:06.050
I long to see the sunlight.

33:06.980 --> 33:09.640
We will soon finish the core mission

33:10.150 --> 33:14.330
of this secret report with Colonel Hatoyama.

33:15.020 --> 33:16.200
But

33:16.830 --> 33:18.160
we're almost out of food.

33:18.390 --> 33:21.420
The colonel asked us to stay here.

33:21.420 --> 33:22.610
We cannot leave.

33:23.790 --> 33:26.810
But he keeps going out alone.

33:27.180 --> 33:28.960
I don't know where he goes.

33:31.590 --> 33:35.040
The hunger is slowly eroding our sanity.

33:35.580 --> 33:36.810
Some even fell down

33:38.310 --> 33:39.920
and never woke up again.

33:43.710 --> 33:45.770
When I was about to give up hope,

33:46.580 --> 33:48.920
Colonel Hatoyama gave me a map

33:49.940 --> 33:51.400
and asked me to go to a place.

34:00.580 --> 34:03.210
Someone above dropped us supplies regularly.

34:03.830 --> 34:04.960
There were some letters too.

34:05.190 --> 34:06.960
It seems like the colonel

34:08.020 --> 34:08.920
found a way to contact the outside world

34:09.060 --> 34:10.670
and get us supplies.

34:10.670 --> 34:11.210
Yes!

34:11.390 --> 34:13.850
But how did he do it?

34:16.870 --> 34:18.080
November 8th.

34:18.870 --> 34:22.730
Colonel Hatoyama said he would venture deeper.

34:23.310 --> 34:24.480
He said he had figured out

34:24.500 --> 34:25.600
this mysterious place.

34:30.980 --> 34:32.810
He told us to stay here

34:33.390 --> 34:38.920
as he brought another troop deeper.

34:40.580 --> 34:41.370
After this entry,

34:41.670 --> 34:43.770
it's only just the daily lives of the Japanese soldiers who stayed.

34:45.540 --> 34:46.370
And in the end,

34:47.910 --> 34:48.690
Jun Tanaka

34:50.390 --> 34:51.650
received a telegram.

35:04.310 --> 35:07.850
Colonel Hatoyama issued the last order.

35:08.350 --> 35:08.890
My comrades,

35:10.140 --> 35:11.730
the mission is in its final phase.

35:12.790 --> 35:14.000
For the honor of Imperial Japan

35:14.420 --> 35:15.920
and His Majesty,

35:17.100 --> 35:19.890
commit seppuku to display your loyalty.

35:21.270 --> 35:23.040
The highest calling will be achieved,

35:24.190 --> 35:24.890
and we

35:25.910 --> 35:27.330
will meet again.

35:58.310 --> 35:59.480
According to the journals,

36:00.390 --> 36:03.330
they descended through this well.

36:07.190 --> 36:09.120
What is down there?

36:10.310 --> 36:10.770
Master Zhang,

36:11.500 --> 36:12.890
didn't Hatoyama say

36:13.100 --> 36:14.080
he had already

36:14.100 --> 36:15.210
figured this place out?

36:15.830 --> 36:17.210
Why did he send a telegram

36:17.870 --> 36:20.250
and ask them to commit suicide?

36:23.830 --> 36:26.850
If the people who were supposed to support them committed suicide,

36:28.230 --> 36:29.480
does it mean

36:30.230 --> 36:31.690
that the troop who went down with him

36:32.140 --> 36:33.520
had also committed suicide?

36:35.710 --> 36:39.080
Asking everyone to commit suicide with just a telegram

36:39.500 --> 36:40.730
is normal for them.

36:42.540 --> 36:44.250
It can make sure

36:44.270 --> 36:45.920
that the secret will stay with them forever.

36:46.190 --> 36:47.250
There's no point in guessing.

36:49.420 --> 36:50.600
Find Hatoyama

36:52.420 --> 36:55.040
and we'll find the answer.

36:56.460 --> 36:59.080
Master Zhang, you sound hesitant.

37:08.350 --> 37:08.850
Xiaojin!

37:20.390 --> 37:20.810
This is...

37:21.270 --> 37:21.690
This is...

37:22.270 --> 37:23.690
Who is sending the telegram?

37:24.670 --> 37:26.770
Could it be Unit 401?

37:29.270 --> 37:29.960
Impossible.

37:30.910 --> 37:31.890
It's a different channel.

37:32.870 --> 37:34.250
Even if Unit 401 was sending a telegram,

37:35.020 --> 37:36.040
they would send it to us.

37:36.190 --> 37:37.250
Why would they send it to the Japanese?

37:40.060 --> 37:40.690
So

37:42.020 --> 37:43.370
the Japanese underground

37:43.390 --> 37:44.650
are writing to us now?

37:46.580 --> 37:47.920
They are still alive?

38:01.450 --> 38:02.210
[It's]

38:05.170 --> 38:06.170
[Extremely]

38:06.170 --> 38:07.050
[Dangerous]

38:07.050 --> 38:07.850
[Please]

38:07.850 --> 38:08.690
[Send]

38:08.690 --> 38:09.650
[Help]

38:11.710 --> 38:12.250
Master.

38:13.060 --> 38:13.600
I have decrypted it.

38:17.210 --> 38:19.410
[It's extremely dangerous. Please send help.]

38:19.670 --> 38:20.920
It's extremely dangerous.

38:21.980 --> 38:23.210
Please send help.

38:24.670 --> 38:26.650
Master, they are asking for help.

38:36.350 --> 38:36.920
Master.

38:37.580 --> 38:39.210
You are my savior.

38:40.020 --> 38:42.250
I could just kowtow to you right now.

38:46.580 --> 38:48.520
What exactly is this place?

38:48.750 --> 38:49.890
I blinked

38:50.580 --> 38:51.850
and suddenly, I'm here.

38:52.460 --> 38:53.210
Exactly, Master.

38:54.140 --> 38:55.400
What is happening?

38:58.540 --> 39:00.650
Master, say something.

39:04.750 --> 39:05.330
Everything is fine.

39:06.540 --> 39:08.000
You were deceived by the shadow.

39:09.710 --> 39:10.600
He brought you here

39:11.390 --> 39:12.120
and imprisoned you.

39:13.620 --> 39:14.440
Are you okay?

39:15.540 --> 39:16.120
I'm fine.

39:17.310 --> 39:17.810
Master.

39:19.620 --> 39:22.400
The shadow put us through this ordeal.

39:22.940 --> 39:24.370
We cannot just let him walk away freely.

39:25.190 --> 39:27.400
We have to catch him before Zhang Qishan does.

39:27.620 --> 39:28.400
That's right, Master.

39:28.420 --> 39:29.370
Don't let him walk away for free.

39:29.390 --> 39:30.170
- We must catch him. - Master.

39:40.270 --> 39:41.120
All of you are safe.

39:42.830 --> 39:43.690
Now, listen to me.

39:44.940 --> 39:45.440
One.

39:46.710 --> 39:48.080
Forget about Zhang Qishan.

39:48.540 --> 39:50.290
We cannot lose our lives for him here.

39:51.420 --> 39:52.480
We must get out of here alive.

39:54.140 --> 39:54.520
Two.

39:57.790 --> 39:59.440
Both of you almost died just now.

40:01.140 --> 40:02.480
I followed the tower's guidance

40:04.190 --> 40:05.170
and brought you back.

40:10.310 --> 40:11.080
Master,

40:11.580 --> 40:13.290
even if we're dumb, you can't...

40:13.460 --> 40:14.120
Do you trust me?

40:15.190 --> 40:15.680
I...

40:15.910 --> 40:16.400
Master.

40:16.620 --> 40:17.370
Do you trust me or not?

40:17.980 --> 40:18.730
- Yes. - Yes.

40:18.740 --> 40:19.810
- We trust you, Master. - Yes.

40:23.870 --> 40:24.480
Juanlian.

40:24.870 --> 40:25.290
Master.

40:25.910 --> 40:26.770
Pack up.

40:27.580 --> 40:28.370
Get ready to leave.

40:28.500 --> 40:28.920
Yes.

40:32.750 --> 40:33.170
Tianpeng.

40:33.670 --> 40:34.080
Just rest.

40:34.350 --> 40:34.770
Sit down.

40:38.910 --> 40:39.400
Xiangu.

40:41.100 --> 40:41.650
It's time to go.

40:45.100 --> 40:45.560
What?

40:50.270 --> 40:51.920
If you think you're making the right call,

40:54.940 --> 40:56.330
then have faith in yourself.

41:01.620 --> 41:02.690
I believe in you.

41:07.350 --> 41:07.850
Okay.

41:11.020 --> 41:11.600
Don't worry.

41:15.140 --> 41:15.520
Let's go.

41:19.100 --> 41:19.650
Let's go.

41:20.140 --> 41:20.730
Yes.

42:19.890 --> 42:24.050
♪The past fades like smoke♪

42:24.410 --> 42:27.130
♪A choice is made in silence♪

42:27.410 --> 42:30.210
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

42:30.610 --> 42:34.370
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

42:34.610 --> 42:38.050
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

42:38.330 --> 42:41.730
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

42:41.810 --> 42:49.090
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

42:49.530 --> 42:52.810
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

42:53.090 --> 42:56.330
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

42:56.490 --> 43:00.530
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

43:00.730 --> 43:04.090
♪Who believes in fate?♪

43:04.330 --> 43:07.690
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

43:07.930 --> 43:11.210
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

43:11.530 --> 43:15.210
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

43:15.410 --> 43:18.650
♪Take care♪

43:18.650 --> 43:21.210
♪We once raced♪

43:21.290 --> 43:23.210
♪For the dawn♪

43:23.370 --> 43:26.650
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

43:26.770 --> 43:30.050
♪In the web of fate♪

43:30.050 --> 43:33.250
♪No one can escape♪

43:34.250 --> 43:36.090
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

43:36.250 --> 43:37.810
♪We too were young once♪

43:37.890 --> 43:41.330
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

43:41.530 --> 43:43.850
♪Keep the ember lit♪

43:43.970 --> 43:48.490
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

43:48.610 --> 43:51.570
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

43:51.810 --> 43:55.330
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

43:55.450 --> 43:59.210
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

43:59.530 --> 44:03.010
♪Who believes in fate?♪

44:03.170 --> 44:06.170
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

44:06.410 --> 44:10.170
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

44:10.330 --> 44:14.050
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

44:14.170 --> 44:25.610
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
